<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Papa Was A Rolling Stone feat. Demi Lovato</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Slash, Demi Lovato</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Papa Was A Rolling Stone feat. Demi Lovato</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3KnOS3OzkdWXI7eWgzVNGk</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.074" end="01:17.074">It was the third of September</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.074" end="01:22.708">That day I'll always remember, yes I will</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.708" end="01:30.708">'Cause that was the day that my daddy died</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.824" end="01:35.024">I never got a chance to see him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.024" end="01:39.224">Never heard nothin' but bad things about him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.224" end="01:44.558">Momma, I'm depending on you to tell me the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.558" end="01:47.290">Momma just hung her head and said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.290" end="01:51.708">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.708" end="01:55.272">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.272" end="02:03.272">And when he died, all he left us was alone"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.641" end="02:07.941">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.941" end="02:11.541">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.541" end="02:19.541">And when he died, all he left us was alone"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.933" end="02:52.984">Hey, Momma!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.984" end="03:00.249">Is it true what they say that Papa never worked a day in his life?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.249" end="03:02.688">Some bad talk goin' round town sayin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.688" end="03:06.938">Papa had three outside children and another wife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.938" end="03:08.988">And that ain't right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.988" end="03:13.072">Heard some talk Papa doing some storefront preachin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.072" end="03:16.921">Talking 'bout saving souls and all the time leechin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.921" end="03:22.404">Dealing in dirt, and stealing in the name of the Lord</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.404" end="03:24.953">Momma just hung her head and said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.953" end="03:29.370">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.370" end="03:32.905">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.905" end="03:40.905">And when he died, all he left us was alone"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.288" end="03:45.521">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.521" end="03:49.188">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:49.188" end="03:57.188">And when he died, all he left us was alone," ooh!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:17.159" end="05:18.992">Hey, Momma!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:18.992" end="05:23.209">I heard Papa called himself a jack-of-all-trades</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:23.209" end="05:27.376">Tell me is that what sent Papa to an early grave?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:27.376" end="05:33.444">Folks say Papa would beg, borrow, steal to pay his bills</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:33.444" end="05:35.425">Hey, Momma!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:35.425" end="05:39.525">Folks say Papa never was much on thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:39.525" end="05:43.360">Spent most of his time chasing women and drinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:43.360" end="05:48.660">Momma, I'm depending on you to tell me the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:48.660" end="05:51.511">Momma looked up with a tear in her eye and said</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:51.511" end="05:53.696">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:53.696" end="05:55.843">Hey, hey, hey, hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:55.843" end="05:58.790">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:58.790" end="06:00.290">Was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:59.393" end="06:07.393">And when he died, all he left us was alone"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="06:07.760" end="06:12.159">"Papa was a rolling stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="06:12.159" end="06:15.625">Wherever he laid his hat was his home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="06:15.625" end="06:23.625">And when he died, all he left us was alone"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="07:11.345" end="07:15.264">Oh, yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="07:15.264" end="07:23.264">Oh, yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="07:25.230" end="07:27.980">Yeah, yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="07:27.980" end="07:35.967">Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="07:35.967" end="07:39.967">Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh</p></div></body></tt>